    <string name="control_service_description">Lets Home Assistant press a button in an app you allowed, such as Play in Plex. It reads a window only while such a request runs, only for an allowed app, and reports nothing but whether the click happened. Only when you switched the screenshot on with a token of your own does it also answer a picture of the screen to a request that carries that token.</string>
